# Stryker copies the project into a sandbox to instrument it. Those copies are real .ts files, so
# both git and vitest will pick them up unless told not to — a stale sandbox means the suite runs a
# MUTATED second copy of itself, which fails in ways that look like the real tests breaking.
.stryker-tmp/
# Where Stryker writes its html/json reports when asked for them.
**/reports/mutation/
